What this grant covers

  - the specification text: README.md, RULES.md, GUIDE.md, REFERENCE.md and
    CHANGELOG.md
  - the schemas: every *.schema.json file, and the scope registry scopes.json
  - the examples in examples/

Attribution

  Credit "Neer Vazhvu", name the NVDM version you used, link to
  https://github.com/SundareshPrasanna/neer-vazhvu/tree/main/schemas/nvdm
  and say if you changed the material.

What this grant does not cover

  - The validator and tooling (scripts/validate_nvdm.py,
    scripts/build_nvdm_reference.py, scripts/nvdm-gate.sh, the writers and the
    scope registry readers) stay under the repository's code licence, MIT.
    See ../../LICENSE.
  - Data artifacts under public/data/ and public/geojson/ are not covered by
    this grant, nor by the MIT licence. Each keeps the terms of its own
    upstream sources. See ../../DATA-LICENSE.md.

Earlier versions

  Versions of these files published before this notice were released under the
  repository's MIT terms and remain available under them.
